    "description": {
      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki per attack</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 150 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fire a seemingly endless barrage of individual small ki blasts. You may make a number of <em>Barrage Attack Rolls</em> up to but not exceeding your <strong>Character Level</strong>, for 12 <strong>Ki</strong> per <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em>, each dealing 1d8 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a successful hit.</p>\n",
